	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d26_sppoke3_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ふしぎな　けはいが　する……！
あたりを　しらべますか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T07:53:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>不思議な　気配が　する……！
周囲を　調べますか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T07:53:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>イベント
・d33イベント後にPOSを踏む
　GRIDX＝、GRIDZ＝
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい　→poke_02
　いいえ→終了
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T07:53:45" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>POKE
ポケモン・アグノム</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T07:54:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
